  "protocol": "Prospective numerical cache-reuse discriminator, not a physics parameter change or acceptance. For passive joint warm start only, preserve maximum alpha in[0,1] with kinetic change L*alpha+Q*alpha^2<=0. Apply same alpha to cached impulses and generated velocity delta. Biased constraint solving retains original spring/motor/limit definitions. Positive prescribed motor speed is excluded from any candidate. Require conservation of pair linear/angular momentum, identical original warm update when already dissipative, finite coefficients, consistent scaled impulses and no kinetic increase in isolated algebra controls. This does not prove Rain acceptance; original residual/anchor/twist checks remain mandatory before any adoption.\n",
  "source": "from pathlib import Path\nimport numpy as np,json\np=Path(__file__).resolve().parent;rng=np.random.default_rng(290926)\nrows=[];max_linear=max_angular=max_energy=0.\nfor case in range(96):\n mass=rng.uniform(.5,5,2);inv=[];I=[]\n for _ in range(2):\n  a=rng.normal(size=(3,3));tensor=a@a.T+np.eye(3);I.append(tensor);inv.append(np.linalg.inv(tensor))\n ra,rb=rng.normal(size=(2,3));positions=[-ra,-rb]\n velocity=rng.normal(size=(2,3));omega=rng.normal(size=(2,3));P,L=rng.normal(size=(2,3))\n dv=np.array([-P/mass[0],P/mass[1]]);dw=np.array([inv[0]@(-np.cross(ra,P)-L),inv[1]@(np.cross(rb,P)+L)])\n energy=lambda v,w:sum(.5*(mass[i]*(v[i]@v[i])+w[i]@I[i]@w[i]) for i in range(2))\n momentum=lambda v,w:(sum(mass[i]*v[i] for i in range(2)),sum(np.cross(positions[i],mass[i]*v[i])+I[i]@w[i] for i in range(2)))\n K0=energy(velocity,omega);Q=energy(dv,dw);linear=sum(mass[i]*(velocity[i]@dv[i])+omega[i]@I[i]@dw[i] for i in range(2));change=linear+Q\n alpha=1. if change<=0 else float(np.clip(-linear/Q,0,1))\n resultv=velocity+alpha*dv;resultw=omega+alpha*dw\n change_actual=energy(resultv,resultw)-K0\n assert abs(change_actual-(linear*alpha+Q*alpha*alpha))<1e-12\n assert change_actual<1e-12\n if change<=0:assert alpha==1.\n oldmom=momentum(velocity,omega);newmom=momentum(resultv,resultw)\n le=float(np.linalg.norm(oldmom[0]-newmom[0]));ae=float(np.linalg.norm(oldmom[1]-newmom[1]));assert le<1e-12 and ae<1e-12\n # Independent reconstruction from consistently scaled physical impulse.\n assert np.max(abs(alpha*dw[0]-inv[0]@(-np.cross(ra,alpha*P)-alpha*L)))<1e-12\n assert np.max(abs(alpha*dw[1]-inv[1]@(np.cross(rb,alpha*P)+alpha*L)))<1e-12\n max_linear=max(max_linear,le);max_angular=max(max_angular,ae);max_energy=max(max_energy,change_actual)\n rows.append({'case':case,'unscaled_change':float(change),'alpha':alpha,'scaled_change':float(change_actual)})\nassert any(r['alpha']==1 for r in rows) and any(0<r['alpha']<1 for r in rows) and any(r['alpha']==0 for r in rows)\nresult={'scope':'Float64 pair-impulse algebra only, not GPU or Rain validation','cases':96,'unchanged':sum(r['alpha']==1 for r in rows),'partial':sum(0<r['alpha']<1 for r in rows),'zero':sum(r['alpha']==0 for r in rows),'max_linear_momentum_error':max_linear,'max_angular_momentum_error':max_angular,'max_energy_increase':max_energy,'rows':rows}\n(p/'result.json').write_text(json.dumps(result,indent=2)+'\\n');print(json.dumps({k:v for k,v in result.items() if k!='rows'},indent=2))\n",
  "source_sha256": "6a0379b9035bd547db13aa60e5b9eaf5ddffcae4d37db5e269a967b139f32673"
}
